  "label": "Historical association of chains with slavery",
  "description": "Chains are a powerful symbol of slavery and oppression in American and global history. The reference to 'chains' in the meme implicitly invokes the historical context of chattel slavery, particularly in the United States, where enslaved Black people were forcibly restrained. This historical context is necessary to understand the racist undertone of the joke.",
